# ─── Site assets: videos, CV, game builds and client work stay out of the public repo ───
# Deploys still include them: the Vercel CLI reads .vercelignore, not this file.
# A Git-connected Vercel deploy would NOT have them, so keep deploying with `vercel --prod`.
